rmissions of typical Dashboard users.\n50\t- Produce an agreed condition-to-status mapping document for Dashboard\n51\t  consumption, covering both deployment modes.\n52\t- No KServe code changes are expected; if gaps are found, document them with\n53\t  a recommended fallback (for example, an alternate condition or event source)\n54\t  rather than fixing KServe in this epic.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- A condition-to-status mapping covering both serverless and raw deployment\n59\t  modes exists and is agreed with the RHOAI Dashboard team.\n60\t- Each of Ready, Progressing, and Failed is derivable from the documented\n61\t  conditions, or any gap is documented together with a fallback the Dashboard\n62\t  can use.\n63\t- Representative failure scenarios (for example, a failed predictor rollout)\n64\t  are verified to produce conditions and events that the mapping classifies\n65\t  as Failed.\n66\t- The accessibility of status conditions and recent events for typical\n67\t  Dashboard user permissions is confirmed and documented.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-1 (P0, validation): the deployment status shown by the Dashboard is\n72\t  derived from validated InferenceService status conditions.\n73\t- HLR-2 (P0, validation): the condition messages and recent events shown in\n74\t  the status detail view are validated as present and accessible.\n75\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b74eb13bf552a6d5","agent_id":"a4b5fc06f5d6c7bf7","session_id":"d9a0c1a1-801a-4eeb-bfda-a0400f18f850","uuid":"aabc7534-69b6-4ea0-82a6-7a8b5a415fa6","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:32:56.189Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b8b5eb7a573e43f5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9001 decomposition"}
