{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bac050ae6444f3c","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tstrat_id: RHAISTRAT-9001\n3\ttitle: Surface model deployment status in the RHOAI Dashboard\n4\tstatus: Refinement Done\n5\tpriority: Major\n6\tlabels:\n7\t- refined\n8\tlinks: []\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t## Problem Statement\n12\t\n13\tData scientists deploying models through the Dashboard cannot tell whether a\n14\tdeployment is healthy without leaving the console. InferenceService state is\n15\tonly visible via `oc get inferenceservice` or by reading Kubernetes events,\n16\twhich most Dashboard users cannot access. Support cases regularly begin with\n17\t\"my model has been Pending for an hour\" — information the platform already has\n18\tbut does not surface.\n19\t\n20\t## High-Level Requirements\n21\t\n22\t| ID | Priority | Requirement |\n23\t|-------|----------|-------------|\n24\t| HLR-1 | P0 | Users see a deployment status (Ready, Progressing, Failed) for each deployed model in the Dashboard model serving views. |\n25\t| HLR-2 | P0 | Users can open a status detail view showing the underlying condition messages and recent events for a failed or progressing deployment. |\n26\t| HLR-3 | P1 | Displayed status reflects the actual InferenceService state within 30 seconds of a change, without a manual page reload. |\n27\t| HLR-4 | P2 | Users can filter and sort the deployed models list by status. |\n28\t| HLR-5 | P2 | Product documentation explains each status value and the first troubleshooting steps for Failed deployments. |\n29\t\n30\t## Affected Components\n31\t\n32\t- Dashboard\n33\t- KServe\n34\t\n35\t## Out of Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Alerting or notifications on status transitions\n38\t- Status history / timeline views\n39\t- ModelMesh deployments (KServe InferenceService only)\n40\t\n41\t## Open Questions\n42\t\n43\tNone blocking — KServe already exposes the needed conditions on the\n44\tInferenceService status; this strategy is about surfacing them.\n45\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a4d67d012daeaa9","agent_id":"a2350addcb37507ed","session_id":"d9a0c1a1-801a-4eeb-bfda-a0400f18f850","uuid":"8defad44-ea10-4c7f-9404-fa99e0c2e384","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:38:22.857Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9bac050ae6444f3c","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9001"}
