s list by status.\n52\t- Content must stay within strategy scope: no coverage of alerting,\n53\t  notifications, status history/timeline views, or ModelMesh deployments.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- Published documentation explains each status value (Ready, Progressing,\n58\t  Failed) and where status is shown in the Dashboard.\n59\t- Published documentation provides first troubleshooting steps for Failed\n60\t  deployments, referencing the condition messages and events available in the\n61\t  status detail view.\n62\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented Dashboard\n63\t  behavior and the validated condition-to-status mapping; review sign-off is\n64\t  recorded.\n65\t- Documentation covers filtering and sorting the deployed models list by\n66\t  status.\n67\t\n68\t## HLR Traceability\n69\t\n70\t- HLR-5 (P2): Product documentation explains each status value and the first\n71\t  troubleshooting steps for Failed deployments.\n72\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9a4d67d012daeaa9","agent_id":"a2350addcb37507ed","session_id":"d9a0c1a1-801a-4eeb-bfda-a0400f18f850","uuid":"587f368d-0927-4940-8ff0-c3710a52452d","timestamp":"2026-10-22T17:38:29.096Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a4964e360882054e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9001"}
